<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Iyaa (YAK) NT en Yaka (Mars 2021)</book>
  <para style="h">Mukaanda a Pawuli wa mioolo kwaa basi Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Te</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukaanda a Pawuli wa mioolo kwaa basi Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukaanda a Pawuli wa mioolo</para>
  <para style="mt1">basi Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili a mukaanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukaanda wa mioolo wu li mu utsuu mu mandaa ma Pawuli akwitsuu mu mo mu mukaanda watsiomi. Bu taanga dili mu ubaalabuwanga, matsimi ma bangaa Kristo mali mu uviinzuu mundaa ti <char style="em">Pfumu Yiisu keni a ayiri avutuu pe</char>. Baata babamosi, ku ngaanda a Tesalonika, bali mu uleele ti, iluumbu kia Pfumu kiamaato (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:2">2.2</ref></char>). Bana bali mu ubisi usala (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:6-12">3.6-12</ref></char>). Bo bali mu umono ti a yabwafwaana pe mu usala mundaa ti, taanga hoolo dimaasaala na Pfumu sa ayiri avutuu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ni mu buu, mu mukaanda wa mioolo wu, Pawuli li mu ubwayiluu ubiindili nziisili a nde. Imiini kia bangaa Kristo a ili mu umaasa pe bukulu ba baata. Kio a ili mu umaasa pe ka mapasi na munyongi. Iluumbu ki Yiisu akaayiri, ni nhaa bakaafuusu mamabi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:5-9">1.5-9</ref></char>). Ka mu taanga di, mamabi mali mu usala mu tsweeyi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-12">2.1-12</ref></char>). Pawuli li mu utsuu mu mo weti nde li mu utsuu mu muutu wu nde ali mu uta «Muutu wahele na Mikele». Muutu wuu ni tuu dili mu ukukuu miheebili mioosi mimibi. Uli na iloo kili mu ukoonoso tuu dii mu uyiluu umonuu. Mu taanga di tuu dii dikaamonuu weti bu dio dili mu ngwanya, sa bafuusu dio. Ka taanga dii keni a diato pe. Mono bwatoono uleele ndaa yi: <char style="em">Mu taanga di Yiisu akaayiri avutuu weti Pfumu a tsi</char>, yo yatoono uleele ti, baata sa bayaaba mamabi weti bu mo mali. Mu yii, mamabi a mubwaba na tuu so hoolo pe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukaanda wu li mu uloombo kwaa bangaa Kristo mu unyaala utsimi ti, bo bamaato ku manini. Taanga di bo bali mu ukebe, a diafwaana pe ukoonoso bo mu usa mandaa ma pasi iluumbu, na mu uyiluu mandaa ma bo bafwaana uyiluu nha tsi.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mabwee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Me Pawuli, Siila na Timoteo, dili mu usonuu mukaanda wu kwaa libuundu la ku ngaanda a Tesalonika. Lo lili libuundu la Nziaambi Taayi a bisi na Pfumu Yiisu Kristo: <verse eid="2TH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Nyaala Nziaambi Taayi a bisi na Pfumu Yiisu Kristo baha beni bweese na iyeenge.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pfuundisi yikaaba mu iluumbu kia nziriri a Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Baana ba nguu, bisi diafwaana ubaavutulanga matoondo kwaa Nziaambi mu ndaa beni. Buli bwafwaana ti bisi diyiluu buu, mundaa ti imiini kia beni ili mu ukulu kwalaa, na litoono li beni boosi dili na lo, bana mu bana, lili mu ubaakulanga taanga dioosi. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Ni mu buu, bisi dili mu ubaabili beni mu kinyi, nha kulu a mabuundu ma Nziaambi. Mundaa ti beni dili mu usa mukonono mu imiini, so bu beni dili mu umono kwaamisa na mapasi.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Kii ili iliimbi kili mu umweese ti pfuundisi a Nziaambi yili yasuungunu. Mundaa ti mandaa ma beni dili mu ukama mutimi mu mo, sa masa ti beni diba babafwaana mu ukoto mu Ipfumu kia Nziaambi, ki beni dili mu umono pasi mu kio. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Mu ngwanya, Nziaambi li asuungunu: Nde sa avutulu mapasi mu mapasi kwaa babali mu umweese beni pasi. <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>Na nde sa aha puumini, kwaa beni ba dili mu umono pasi, na kwaa bisi ka. Mii sa miyilimi mu taanga di Pfumu Yiisu akaamonuu ku yula na batumu ba lituu. <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>Nde sa ayiri kutso mbaa yinene yili mu ululuu, mu usieembe babali mu ubisi uyaaba Nziaambi, na babali mu ubisi usiingi Ndaa Yimbwe ya Pfumu a bisi Yiisu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Tsieembili a bo sa yiba pfuuyili ya bilimi na bilimi. Bo sa baba la na kiinzi kia Pfumu, na lituu la buzitu ba nde. <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>Maa sa mayilimi weti buu, mu iluumbu ki nde akaayiri, mu uholo mbilili na likiinzi kwaa boosi babali baba nde, na babasa imiini mu nde. Beni sa diba beni bame mu kaba la bo, mundaa ti beni diasi imiini mu Mandaa ma bisi diayaabisi beni.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Ni mu buu, bisi dili mu ubaakuundanga taanga dioosi mu beni. Bisi dili mu uloombo kwaa Nziaambi a bisi, paa asa ti beni diba babafwaana mu idiingi ki nde ati beni mbili. Bisi dili mu uloombo kwaa nde ti, mu lituu la nde, abaasila beni mu ukuusu manzala ma beni ma uyiluu mamabwe, na asa ti imiini kia beni imonuu mu bisala. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Mu yii, kuumbu a Pfumu a bisi Yiisu sa yiholo mbilili mu beni, na beni sa diholo mbilili kwaa nde. Ni buu bukaaba bweese ba Nziaambi a bisi na ba Pfumu Yiisu Kristo.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Mandaa makaakwayilimi tswaamina nziriri a Pfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Baana ba nguu! Mu yatala nziriri a Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo, na mvuutini a bisi nha peembi a nde, bisi diloombi beni ndaa yi: <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>a dinyaala pe ti matsimi ma beni maviinzuu mu mawasa, so uba na boomo mbiiti muutu leeli ti iluumbu kia Pfumu kiamaato. A di sa nde imiini pe, so baleeli ti yo yili mbilili, so mukeenzi, so mukaanda wumati kwaa bisi. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>A dinyaala pe ti muutu so moosi afutu beni, so yaba ti a buni. Mundaa ti, iluumbu kii a ito pe tswaamina baata butemenene Nziaambi, na tswaamini a Muutu wahele na Mikele umonuu, ni muutu wubataasila ku pfuuyili. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>Ni nde mutaata wukaatemenene bioosi bi baata bali mu ukuundu na bi baata bali mu umono ti bili bia Nziaambi. Nde sa atemenene bii bioosi, na nde sa akoto natee mu nzo a Nziaambi mu udiaala muu, na uleele ti nde makulu ni Nziaambi.<verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Beni a dili mu ulibili pe moonyi ti me naleeli beni buu, mu taanga di me nali keni kwaa beni? <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Ka bunu beni diayaaba ti iloo imoosi ili mu ukaanga nde mu taanga di, paa ti nde amonuu ndila mu taanga di Nziaambi akesi. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Ka lituu la Muutu wahele na Mikele lamaakwabaanduu usala mu tsweeyi mu taanga di. Ka ndila ti, lo sa liyiluu usala mu taanga di muutu wuli keni akaanga lo, akaaha lo bunyanga. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Tumake, muutu me wuu sa amonuu, na Pfumu Yiisu sa adusu nde mu mupepe a munywa a nde, nde sa fuhuusu nde mu buzitu ba nziriri a nde. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Muutu me sa ayiri na lituu la Saatina, nde sa ayiluu bimaanga bia mupili na mupili, na biliimbi bia ukimuu bia pia. <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>Nde sa asalila bubi mu makuulu moosi, mu ufutu baata ba buyene ku pfuuyili a bo. Bo sa bafuu mundaa ti bo a bayaki pe na a batooni pe ngwanya yakeni uyobolo bo. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Ni mu buu, Nziaambi ali mu utsinduu bo lituu la ndiimbisi, lili mu utsindi bo mu usa imiini mu mandaa ma pia. <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>Mu yii, baata boosi babuhele usa imiini mu ngwanya, ka babumono kinyi mu mamabi, sa basieembe bo.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Beni badisiooli mu ndaa liyobolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Ka baana ba nguu, mu yatala bisi, bisi diafwaana ubaavutulaanga matoondo kwaa Nziaambi taanga dioosi mu beni, beni ba Pfumu atoono. Mundaa ti Nziaambi asiooli beni, beni ba tsiomi, paa ti beni diholo liyobolo mu libaasila la mu Muheebili wa ngira, wuli mu uha beni idiingi kia ngira, na mu libaasila la imiini kia beni mu ngwanya. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Nziaambi ati beni mbila mu ndaa yii, mukuulu a Ndaa Yimbwe yi bisi diayaabisi kwaa beni. Nde atoono ti beni dibaa ikuku mu buzitu ba Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Ni mu buu, baana ba nguu, diba bahama na dikebe nziisili yi bisi diahi beni, so yaba ya mu mandaa ma munywa, so ya mu mikaanda.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Nyaala Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo nde makulu, na Nziaambi Taayi a bisi, watoono bisi, na waheeri bisi mu bweese ba nde, mboondili ya bilimi na bilimi na ilimbisi ki ibwe, <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>baluusu mitimi mia beni mu pamini, na baha beni mifuri mu usalila mamabwe, mu biyiluu na mu mandaa ma munywa.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Dikuundu mu bisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Baana ba nguu, nha tsieelele, dikuundu mu bisi, paa ti mandaa ma Pfumu matsaamuu mu mawasa na bakiinzi mo, weti bu mayilimi nha kati a beni. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Dikuundu ka Nziaambi paa nde akuulu bisi nha mioo mia baata bababi na bangaa ibaala. Mundaa ti, a baata boosi pe bali mu usiingi usa imiini. <verse eid="2TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Ka Pfumu li anambita mu mandaa ma nde. Nde sa aha beni mifuri na sa akala beni kwaa Wumubi. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Na Pfumu li mu uha bisi ilimbisi mu beni: bisi diayaaba ti, beni dili mu uyiluu, na beni sa dihama mu uyiluu, mi bisi dili mu utumu beni. <verse eid="2TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Nyaala Pfumu abiti mitimi mia beni mu utoono Nziaambi, na mu kamini a mutimi yi Kristo ali mu uha.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndutu a isala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Baana ba nguu, bisi diloombi kwaa beni mu kuumbu a Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo: ditakuu na baana ba nguu babali na bubolo, na babali mu uhele uduku nziisili yi bisi diahi bo. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Beni diayaaba beni bame, buni beni diafwaana uduku ndiaatili a bisi. Mundaa ti, bisi a diadiaati pe kutso bubolo nha kati a beni. <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>Bisi a dialoombi pe kwaa muutu mu ubuungulu bisi kwa ibuu. Ka kutso mapasi na ndeeyili, bisi diasiali butsuu na nyanga, paa dinyaala uba mufunu kwaa muutu so mosi mu beni. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Bisi diayilii buu, a mundaa pe ti bisi a diali na muswa pe wa uyaka libaasila la beni, ka mundaa ti bisi diatooni uha beni ifwaani ki beni diduku. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Mu ngwanya, mu taanga di bisi diali kwaa beni, bisi diaduti beni matswi ti: «Pasi wahele utoono usala, afwaana ka unyaala udia.»<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Ka, bisi dili mu uyuu ti, babamosi mu beni, bali mu usa bubolo, kwahele usa isala, so a ndila mu ukoto mu mandaa matala bakimi pe. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Kwaa baata baa, bisi dili mu uloombo kwaa bo, na bisi dili mu utumu bo miinami mu kuumbu a Pfumu Yiisu Kristo: Bo bafwaana usala mu iyeenge taanga dioosi, mu ubaa bia udia bia bo makulu. <verse eid="2TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Ka kwaa beni, baana ba nguu, a dikoono pe mu uyiluu mamabwe.<verse eid="2TH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>So muutu heli utumumu nziisili yi bisi dili mu uha mu mukaanda wu, ditungululu nde, na a dibwaba pe itwaari na nde, paa nde amono tsionyi. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Ka a diholo nde weti mutata a beni pe, ka diha nde mandoongi weti mwaana a nguu a beni.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lisieme na mabwee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Nyaala Pfumu, idia kia iyeenge, nde makulu abaahaanganga beni iyeenge taanga dioosi na mu mandaa moosi. Nyaala Pfumu aba na beni boosi. <verse eid="2TH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Mu koo kia me makulu me ndi mu usonuu mandaa ma: Mabwee ma Pawuli. Mono bu me nibaanyeme mikaanda mia me mioosi. Ni buu me nibaasonuu. <verse eid="2TH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Nyaala bweese ba Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo baba na beni boosi.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
